s_template":false,"web_commit_signoff_required":false,"has_pull_requests":true,"pull_request_creation_policy":"all","topics":["airflow","apache","apache-airflow","automation","dag","data-engineering","data-integration","data-orchestrator","data-pipelines","data-science","elt","etl","machine-learning","mlops","orchestration","python","scheduler","workflow","workflow-engine","workflow-orchestration"],"visibility":"public","forks":18214,"open_issues":1927,"watchers":47308,"default_branch":"main","permissions":{"admin":false,"maintain":false,"push":false,"triage":false,"pull":true}},"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/apache/airflow/pulls/69960","html_url":"https://github.com/apache/airflow/pull/69960","diff_url":"https://github.com/apache/airflow/pull/69960.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/apache/airflow/pull/69960.patch","merged_at":null},"body":"Closes #69934\n\n## Summary\n\nEvery time the `DagBundlesManager` is initialised (which happens at task startup for each task run) it emits an INFO-level log line listing every configured bundle:\n\n```\nINFO - DAG bundles loaded: dags-folder, bundle-a, bundle-b, ...\n```\n\nFor deployments with many bundles this generates tens or hundreds of redundant lines in every task log. The message is useful for debugging configuration but has no operational value during normal task execution.\n\nThis commit downgrades the log call from `self.log.info` to `self.log.debug`. The message is still available when debug logging is enabled.\n\n## Changes\n\n- `airflow-core/src/airflow/dag_processing/bundles/manager.py`: `log.info` → `log.debug` for the bundle-loaded message.\n\n<!-- pr-triage-fold: triaged=2026-07-28T16:21:40Z head=d1fc5d9 action=comment -->\n\n---\n\n> [!IMPORTANT]\n> **🛠️ Maintainer triage note for @nagasrisai** · by `@potiuk` · 2026-07-28 16:21 UTC\n>\n> Helpful heads-up from the maintainers — please address before this PR can be reviewed:\n> - :x: **Pre-commit / static checks**. See [docs](https://github.com/apache/airflow/blob/main/contributing-docs/08_static_code_checks.rst).\n>\n> **The ball is in your court** — you've been assigned to this PR. Fix the above, then mark it **Ready for review**.\n>\n> See the [Pull Request quality criteria](https://github.com/apache/airflow/blob/main/contributing-docs/05_pull_requests.rst#pull-request-quality-criteria) for how to fix each item. There is no rush.\n>\n> **Note:** your branch is **2835 commits behind `main`** — please rebase and push again to get up-to-date CI results.\n>\n> <sub>_Automated triage — may be imperfect; a maintainer takes the next look. We use this [two-stage triage process](https://github.com/apache/airflow/blob/main/contributing-docs/25_maintainer_pr_triage.md#why-the-first-pass-is-automated) so maintainers' limited time goes to the conversation with you._</sub>\n\n<!-- /pr-triage-fold -->\n","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/apache/airflow/issues/69960/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/apache/airflow/issues/69960/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}},"event":"cross-referenced"},{"id":31053286551,"node_id":"LE_lADOAgUK288AAAABI8KzcM8AAAAHOuuMlw","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/apache/airflow/issues/events/31053286551","actor":{"login":"shahar1","id":60007259,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYwMDA3MjU5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/60007259?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/shahar1","html_url":"https://github.com/shahar1","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shahar1/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shahar1/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shahar1/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shahar1/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shahar1/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://a